    "created_at": "2017-09-30T23:32:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-30T23:32:46Z",
    "body": "For this particular case (after the scheme), it is [special authority ignore slashes state](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#special-authority-ignore-slashes-state). For all other cases, go to [basic URL parser](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-basic-url-parser) and <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>F</kbd> \"U+005C (\\\\)\".",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
