    "updated_at": "2017-09-30T23:33:10Z",
    "body": "Note, backslashes are not considered to be \"valid\", only \"accepted\", since a validation error is fired in [special authority slashes state](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#special-authority-slashes-state) before going to special authority ignore slashes state.",
