    "created_at": "2022-01-02T19:12:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-01-02T19:12:41Z",
    "body": "Here's a fun example of what happens when some people implement RFC 3986 and some follow WHATWG's \"loose\" definition: <https://bugs.xdavidhu.me/google/2021/12/31/fixing-the-unfixable-story-of-a-google-cloud-ssrf/>. Not my story, but I ran across it today, then ended up here after trying to figure out why WHATWG is including this character.",
